{"hw":"πεῖσα","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πεῖσα</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πεῖσα</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ης</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">πείθω</span>) poet. for <span class=\"gk\">πειθώ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">obedience</b>, <span class=\"gk\">τῷ δὲ μάλ' ἐν πείσῃ κραδίη μένε</span>, i.e. it remained calm, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.23</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.453d</span> </span>, Hdn.Gr. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.266</span> </span>.</div></div>"}